{
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "jfk",
      "path": "clips/jfk.wav",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": true,
      "text": "And so my fellow Americans, ask not what your country can do for you, ask what you can do for your country.",
      "source": "whisper.cpp samples/jfk.wav: John F. Kennedy, inaugural address, 1961",
      "license": "public domain (US government work); file distributed with whisper.cpp (MIT)"
    },
    {
      "id": "61-70968-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/61-70968-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": true,
      "text": "HE BEGAN A CONFUSED COMPLAINT AGAINST THE WIZARD WHO HAD VANISHED BEHIND THE CURTAIN ON THE LEFT",
      "seconds": 4.91,
      "sha256": "fd3c84146d8b357efc7f0d21de86de770721fc5ddac7e6577688dbf3cdabff5b",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 61-70968-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "121-121726-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/121-121726-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "ALSO A POPULAR CONTRIVANCE WHEREBY LOVE MAKING MAY BE SUSPENDED BUT NOT STOPPED DURING THE PICNIC SEASON",
      "seconds": 8.46,
      "sha256": "81378fdb3e648b43efb1cb8c4f87da3fc9cfbe19c5dda97e9e7361c4a2470d2f",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 121-121726-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "237-126133-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/237-126133-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "HERE SHE WOULD STAY COMFORTED AND SOOTHED AMONG THE LOVELY PLANTS AND RICH EXOTICS REJOICING THE HEART OF OLD TURNER THE GARDENER WHO SINCE POLLY'S FIRST RAPTUROUS ENTRANCE HAD TAKEN HER INTO HIS GOOD GRACES FOR ALL TIME",
      "seconds": 13.29,
      "sha256": "25466538df82602d1e597b0cb016e4dd0ce11031cb8994a4289d1c07170878ee",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 237-126133-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "260-123286-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/260-123286-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "SATURDAY AUGUST FIFTEENTH THE SEA UNBROKEN ALL ROUND NO LAND IN SIGHT",
      "seconds": 7.04,
      "sha256": "d654a43d06f0e8b586b525e8ec83d6e3c0dc83c3f4742f8e25fd291db77248b3",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 260-123286-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "672-122797-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/672-122797-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "OUT IN THE WOODS STOOD A NICE LITTLE FIR TREE",
      "seconds": 4.07,
      "sha256": "776b1ce553e7ecb2dc0254b2aa4b35af0bde50db65dbf7bdbdfa1560a2c9ec36",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 672-122797-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "908-31957-0001",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/908-31957-0001.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": true,
      "text": "I SIT BENEATH THY LOOKS AS CHILDREN DO IN THE NOON SUN WITH SOULS THAT TREMBLE THROUGH THEIR HAPPY EYELIDS FROM AN UNAVERRED YET PRODIGAL INWARD JOY",
      "seconds": 11.31,
      "sha256": "2782509f3e0125cdc87858930b23fac16cc438cadf87ea107605c97f31f334f0",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 908-31957-0001",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "1089-134686-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/1089-134686-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "HE HOPED THERE WOULD BE STEW FOR DINNER TURNIPS AND CARROTS AND BRUISED POTATOES AND FAT MUTTON PIECES TO BE LADLED OUT IN THICK PEPPERED FLOUR FATTENED SAUCE",
      "seconds": 10.44,
      "sha256": "30885601173f96b0d8ddd020dc959b055c6c1582b85a33e3fcab8c4b08ed94c2",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 1089-134686-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "1188-133604-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/1188-133604-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "YOU WILL FIND ME CONTINUALLY SPEAKING OF FOUR MEN TITIAN HOLBEIN TURNER AND TINTORET IN ALMOST THE SAME TERMS",
      "seconds": 10.72,
      "sha256": "4a10149395cb5af8aa5d04ef3adb49b3980baa93114d0851046e6343744b26cb",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 1188-133604-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "1221-135766-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/1221-135766-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "HOW STRANGE IT SEEMED TO THE SAD WOMAN AS SHE WATCHED THE GROWTH AND THE BEAUTY THAT BECAME EVERY DAY MORE BRILLIANT AND THE INTELLIGENCE THAT THREW ITS QUIVERING SUNSHINE OVER THE TINY FEATURES OF THIS CHILD",
      "seconds": 12.44,
      "sha256": "1f6b9ba126dc0f0a3cb813b04e2c970ff9583beeaf8cfaa8f7c8199244aa2514",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 1221-135766-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "1284-1180-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/1284-1180-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "HE WORE BLUE SILK STOCKINGS BLUE KNEE PANTS WITH GOLD BUCKLES A BLUE RUFFLED WAIST AND A JACKET OF BRIGHT BLUE BRAIDED WITH GOLD",
      "seconds": 8.12,
      "sha256": "1b76cef86ab0f918aac7f576be7398f29bfa968e6c78bdf024c335faedd378f1",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 1284-1180-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "1320-122612-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/1320-122612-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": true,
      "text": "SINCE THE PERIOD OF OUR TALE THE ACTIVE SPIRIT OF THE COUNTRY HAS SURROUNDED IT WITH A BELT OF RICH AND THRIVING SETTLEMENTS THOUGH NONE BUT THE HUNTER OR THE SAVAGE IS EVER KNOWN EVEN NOW TO PENETRATE ITS WILD RECESSES",
      "seconds": 13.48,
      "sha256": "2f914687b13e1864d267282c3749ab6f0b6a5b7dcb2b772f28b6a3af7854859e",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 1320-122612-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "1580-141083-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/1580-141083-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "I WILL ENDEAVOUR IN MY STATEMENT TO AVOID SUCH TERMS AS WOULD SERVE TO LIMIT THE EVENTS TO ANY PARTICULAR PLACE OR GIVE A CLUE AS TO THE PEOPLE CONCERNED",
      "seconds": 8.94,
      "sha256": "59123e88017e4bf645e39506a878b5734b3d94fe990018de25b712ba881cf7a5",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 1580-141083-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "1995-1826-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/1995-1826-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "IN THE DEBATE BETWEEN THE SENIOR SOCIETIES HER DEFENCE OF THE FIFTEENTH AMENDMENT HAD BEEN NOT ONLY A NOTABLE BIT OF REASONING BUT DELIVERED WITH REAL ENTHUSIASM",
      "seconds": 9.48,
      "sha256": "74596627a026feb72e3acba17ee9268f120ee25e9f4afb935bb2f3d3ba779e57",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 1995-1826-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "2094-142345-0001",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/2094-142345-0001.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "BUT THE WINDOWS ARE PATCHED WITH WOODEN PANES AND THE DOOR I THINK IS LIKE THE GATE IT IS NEVER OPENED",
      "seconds": 8.03,
      "sha256": "b4fb8a76b5026b1cff5193cba298dc66156f93e228a221a06d26790c34cc049f",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 2094-142345-0001",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "2300-131720-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/2300-131720-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "THE PARIS PLANT LIKE THAT AT THE CRYSTAL PALACE WAS A TEMPORARY EXHIBIT",
      "seconds": 5.08,
      "sha256": "84cb3f03857e7a68d5811c2f07f14725f8583a61d3a280816e30ec44956d8d7e",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 2300-131720-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "2830-3979-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/2830-3979-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": true,
      "text": "WE WANT YOU TO HELP US PUBLISH SOME LEADING WORK OF LUTHER'S FOR THE GENERAL AMERICAN MARKET WILL YOU DO IT",
      "seconds": 6.12,
      "sha256": "b21719bb12120d2ec798c65e4b251c3dca7a002d2c5fda59859524b171fa9d5c",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 2830-3979-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "2961-960-0001",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/2961-960-0001.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "THE INFLUENCE WITH THE TIMAEUS HAS EXERCISED UPON POSTERITY IS DUE PARTLY TO A MISUNDERSTANDING",
      "seconds": 8.25,
      "sha256": "73a2c08a15dc492ae512877618f9bd2ba6dd8b3c1bd5a5e8d59ef63d7ef3d5fb",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 2961-960-0001",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "3570-5694-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/3570-5694-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "BUT ALREADY AT A POINT IN ECONOMIC EVOLUTION FAR ANTEDATING THE EMERGENCE OF THE LADY SPECIALISED CONSUMPTION OF GOODS AS AN EVIDENCE OF PECUNIARY STRENGTH HAD BEGUN TO WORK OUT IN A MORE OR LESS ELABORATE SYSTEM",
      "seconds": 12.09,
      "sha256": "55049eed3f6a821b44b5b8d0e2a7348fc01692fc79981ec56b140ac0f051579e",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 3570-5694-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "3575-170457-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/3575-170457-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "AND OFTEN HAS MY MOTHER SAID WHILE ON HER LAP I LAID MY HEAD SHE FEARED FOR TIME I WAS NOT MADE BUT FOR ETERNITY",
      "seconds": 8.23,
      "sha256": "96ab958dda879bdd4bc9fc61c2e5b0d632c569c256b54bcb1c0ecbeadd31448e",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 3575-170457-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "3729-6852-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/3729-6852-0000.flac",
      "split": "dev",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "TO CELEBRATE THE ARRIVAL OF HER SON SILVIA GAVE A SPLENDID SUPPER TO WHICH SHE HAD INVITED ALL HER RELATIVES AND IT WAS A GOOD OPPORTUNITY FOR ME TO MAKE THEIR ACQUAINTANCE",
      "seconds": 11.17,
      "sha256": "3fa96f8e0276d79ec027bb1595215a8bbeb488cefcc1702ff798e91ec8504403",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 3729-6852-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "4077-13751-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/4077-13751-0000.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": true,
      "text": "ON THE SIXTH OF APRIL EIGHTEEN THIRTY THE CHURCH OF JESUS CHRIST OF LATTER DAY SAINTS WAS FORMALLY ORGANIZED AND THUS TOOK ON A LEGAL EXISTENCE",
      "seconds": 9.56,
      "sha256": "d76a732a69cca08d2f249fae5e63b28e417e5569e3233915f22f28c08a67c21a",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 4077-13751-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "4446-2271-0001",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/4446-2271-0001.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "HE HAD PRECONCEIVED IDEAS ABOUT EVERYTHING AND HIS IDEA ABOUT AMERICANS WAS THAT THEY SHOULD BE ENGINEERS OR MECHANICS",
      "seconds": 6.35,
      "sha256": "0469768ab489b6855389d9ac8532b7dde006891820d8137913d7789965b07c89",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 4446-2271-0001",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "4507-16021-0001",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/4507-16021-0001.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "IT ENGENDERS A WHOLE WORLD LA PEGRE FOR WHICH READ THEFT AND A HELL LA PEGRENNE FOR WHICH READ HUNGER",
      "seconds": 11.32,
      "sha256": "3fec8e81e775deb6b2cc2bbbb24463289953d7c249157437f6bf3c043f1840c9",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 4507-16021-0001",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "4970-29093-0001",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/4970-29093-0001.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "TO THE YOUNG AMERICAN HERE OR ELSEWHERE THE PATHS TO FORTUNE ARE INNUMERABLE AND ALL OPEN THERE IS INVITATION IN THE AIR AND SUCCESS IN ALL HIS WIDE HORIZON",
      "seconds": 11.92,
      "sha256": "701b3334cfbacfb695b56f66d970f84896f81587199d7f0c0d3ad688bd925aa7",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 4970-29093-0001",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "4992-23283-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/4992-23283-0000.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "BUT THE MORE FORGETFULNESS HAD THEN PREVAILED THE MORE POWERFUL WAS THE FORCE OF REMEMBRANCE WHEN SHE AWOKE",
      "seconds": 6.64,
      "sha256": "64122420d3d47dd37b655b06bf212ab45c5c671b8b5f8950aff5f355e811db79",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 4992-23283-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "5105-28233-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/5105-28233-0000.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": true,
      "text": "LENGTH OF SERVICE FOURTEEN YEARS THREE MONTHS AND FIVE DAYS",
      "seconds": 4.51,
      "sha256": "d8feecd74fe14ae2f00c1c2f65ba77c07f82dbd76aaa0934f3569f91f2b14d34",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 5105-28233-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "5142-33396-0001",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/5142-33396-0001.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "WHAT IS YOUR COUNTRY OLAF HAVE YOU ALWAYS BEEN A THRALL THE THRALL'S EYES FLASHED",
      "seconds": 5.02,
      "sha256": "be7ea6c5995e58166c31b9d2ccb260d5ddb0eed705ec71de0d1787bc3728de13",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 5142-33396-0001",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "5639-40744-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/5639-40744-0000.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "ELEVEN O'CLOCK HAD STRUCK IT WAS A FINE CLEAR NIGHT THEY WERE THE ONLY PERSONS ON THE ROAD AND THEY SAUNTERED LEISURELY ALONG TO AVOID PAYING THE PRICE OF FATIGUE FOR THE RECREATION PROVIDED FOR THE TOLEDANS IN THEIR VALLEY OR ON THE BANKS OF THEIR RIVER",
      "seconds": 15.77,
      "sha256": "5f25c4ad283ffb96549c83498dd4255ec20fd1470c7e4041d5c5b3ac86e62606",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 5639-40744-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "5683-32865-0004",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/5683-32865-0004.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "WHATEVER LORD CHELFORD SAID MISS BRANDON RECEIVED IT VERY GRACIOUSLY AND EVEN WITH A MOMENTARY SMILE",
      "seconds": 7.37,
      "sha256": "5911472cd5869d7b256eb28e465acbc23a9b215aa96f6cbb1714c893ccbd0a69",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 5683-32865-0004",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "6829-68769-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/6829-68769-0000.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "KENNETH AND BETH REFRAINED FROM TELLING THE OTHER GIRLS OR UNCLE JOHN OF OLD WILL ROGERS'S VISIT BUT THEY GOT MISTER WATSON IN THE LIBRARY AND QUESTIONED HIM CLOSELY ABOUT THE PENALTY FOR FORGING A CHECK",
      "seconds": 11.7,
      "sha256": "2f5d7ee4899ac1ba7bd170757a30b3679aad182830b0900d27967761e6f60826",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 6829-68769-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "6930-75918-0001",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/6930-75918-0001.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": true,
      "text": "THE ENGLISH FORWARDED TO THE FRENCH BASKETS OF FLOWERS OF WHICH THEY HAD MADE A PLENTIFUL PROVISION TO GREET THE ARRIVAL OF THE YOUNG PRINCESS THE FRENCH IN RETURN INVITED THE ENGLISH TO A SUPPER WHICH WAS TO BE GIVEN THE NEXT DAY",
      "seconds": 14.22,
      "sha256": "3dfad7eb0793eddd5040d04f1f2f3046ceeee39e0ec461794856a350e1bd728e",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 6930-75918-0001",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "7021-79730-0001",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/7021-79730-0001.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "TO SUPPOSE THAT THE OBJECT OF THIS WORK IS TO AID IN EFFECTING SUCH A SUBSTITUTION AS THAT IS ENTIRELY TO MISTAKE ITS NATURE AND DESIGN",
      "seconds": 11.49,
      "sha256": "e3c99827d8617e55b049399baf4bf190bb51a51dc1dc2e4572519029968e49ba",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 7021-79730-0001",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "7127-75946-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/7127-75946-0000.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "AT THE CONCLUSION OF THE BANQUET WHICH WAS SERVED AT FIVE O'CLOCK THE KING ENTERED HIS CABINET WHERE HIS TAILORS WERE AWAITING HIM FOR THE PURPOSE OF TRYING ON THE CELEBRATED COSTUME REPRESENTING SPRING WHICH WAS THE RESULT OF SO MUCH IMAGINATION AND HAD COST SO MANY EFFORTS OF THOUGHT TO THE DESIGNERS AND ORNAMENT WORKERS OF THE COURT",
      "seconds": 19.48,
      "sha256": "70dfaf079f9d7432d074b025d5fc63898557677324fea88c4482f0f92f687c45",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 7127-75946-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "7176-88083-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/7176-88083-0000.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "ALL ABOUT HIM WAS A TUMULT OF BRIGHT AND BROKEN COLOR SCATTERED IN BROAD SPLASHES",
      "seconds": 5.7,
      "sha256": "bf4b56c5f7dc90dd70d7b7322155286d8c092010f9891269601f899c95f1b73b",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 7176-88083-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "7729-102255-0002",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/7729-102255-0002.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "THAT SUMMER'S EMIGRATION HOWEVER BEING MAINLY FROM THE FREE STATES GREATLY CHANGED THE RELATIVE STRENGTH OF THE TWO PARTIES",
      "seconds": 8.3,
      "sha256": "7d5de46782c4be843229d050c67eaecd3ef51922fd42d2810f26534efa82a212",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 7729-102255-0002",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "8224-274381-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/8224-274381-0000.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": true,
      "text": "THOUGH THROWN INTO PRISON FOR THIS ENTERPRISE AND DETAINED SOME TIME HE WAS NOT DISCOURAGED BUT STILL CONTINUED BY HIS COUNTENANCE AND PROTECTION TO INFUSE SPIRIT INTO THE DISTRESSED ROYALISTS",
      "seconds": 17.74,
      "sha256": "4339631344dbb058d76477692992ade4b209993e64ecea0fb031b96c6babcd49",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 8224-274381-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "8230-279154-0000",
      "path": "clips/librispeech/8230-279154-0000.flac",
      "split": "heldout",
      "gate": false,
      "text": "THE ANALYSIS OF KNOWLEDGE WILL OCCUPY US UNTIL THE END OF THE THIRTEENTH LECTURE AND IS THE MOST DIFFICULT PART OF OUR WHOLE ENTERPRISE",
      "seconds": 8.8,
      "sha256": "27f288ccebd4a68b77e7721d164bbed2e67c4da24155a4253a14f3abd9cf7d0f",
      "source": "LibriSpeech test-clean 8230-279154-0000",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
